{"ticker":"FFIV","updated":"2026-10-23T22:59:12Z","profile":{"longName":"F5, Inc.","shortName":"F5, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.f5.com","fullTimeEmployees":6512,"marketCap":25789153280,"trailingPE":36.28845,"forwardPE":25.193676,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.7928576,"pegRatio":1.61,"targetMeanPrice":437.8,"targetHighPrice":525.0,"targetLowPrice":300.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.109,"earningsGrowth":0.114,"grossMargins":0.81865996,"operatingMargins":0.24649,"profitMargins":0.21952999,"totalRevenue":3309331968,"beta":1.028,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":483.3,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":223.76,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"F5, Inc. provides multicloud application security and delivery solutions in the United States, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific region. The company's distributed cloud services enable its customers to deploy, secure, and operate applications in any architecture, from on-premises to the public cloud. It also offers unified, security, networking, and application management solutions, such as web app and API protection; multi-cloud networking; application delivery and deployment; domain name system; content delivery network; and application deployment and orchestration. In addition, the company provides application security and delivery products, including NGINX Plus; NGINX One Console; NGINX Ingress Controller; WAF for NGINX; BIG-IP Packaged Software; and BIG-IP Systems. Further, it provides a range of professional services, including maintenance, consulting, training, and other technical support services. The company sells its products to large enterprise businesses, public sector institutions, governments, and service providers through distributors, value-added resellers, managed service providers, systems integrators, and other indirect channel partners. It has partnerships with public cloud providers, such as Amazon Web Services, Microsoft Azure, and Google Cloud Platform. The company was formerly known as F5 Networks, Inc. and changed its name to F5, Inc","summary_zh":"F5, Inc. 在美國、歐洲、中東、非洲和亞太地區提供多雲應用程式安全和交付解決方案。該公司的分散式雲端服務使客戶能夠在從本地到公有雲的任何架構中部署、保護和操作應用程式。它還提供統一、安全性、網路和應用程式管理解決方案，例如 Web 應用程式和 API 保護；多雲網路；應用程式交付和部署；網域名稱系統；內容交付網路；以及應用程式部署和編排。此外，該公司還提供應用安全和交付產品，包括NGINX Plus； NGINX 一個控制台； NGINX 入口控制器；NGINX 的 WAF；BIG-IP 套裝軟體；和 BIG-IP 系統。此外，它還提供一系列專業服務，包括維護、諮詢、培訓和其他技術支援服務。該公司透過分銷商、加值經銷商、託管服務提供商、系統整合商和其他間接通路合作夥伴向大型企業、公共部門機構、政府和服務提供者銷售其產品。它與 Amazon Web Services、Microsoft Azure 和 Google Cloud Platform 等公有雲供應商建立了合作夥伴關係。該公司原名為 F5 Networks, Inc.，現更名為 F5, Inc.","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":317.41,"h":317.58,"l":315.48,"c":315.7,"v":246800},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":316.98,"h":319.14,"l":313.22,"c":315.57,"v":694700},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":315.24,"h":318.53,"l":314.71,"c":317.74,"v":249600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":317.0,"h":320.25,"l":315.24,"c":318.4,"v":414200},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":319.07,"h":319.07,"l":310.33,"c":313.14,"v":593500},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":309.89,"h":311.12,"l":306.04,"c":306.73,"v":598900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":305.94,"h":309.12,"l":303.61,"c":309.03,"v":450600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":310.16,"h":314.74,"l":309.33,"c":314.35,"v":400900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":314.35,"h":317.03,"l":311.87,"c":315.89,"v":311000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":316.57,"h":320.8,"l":316.52,"c":320.63,"v":316400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":319.86,"h":329.81,"l":318.53,"c":325.41,"v":429000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":326.6,"h":329.23,"l":322.56,"c":326.69,"v":394800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":326.69,"h":337.39,"l":326.69,"c":334.59,"v":465200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":332.49,"h":332.49,"l":320.97,"c":321.67,"v":439900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":320.27,"h":324.94,"l":319.72,"c":324.1,"v":355400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":324.05,"h":325.0,"l":321.29,"c":323.73,"v":289000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":324.79,"h":326.0,"l":320.54,"c":323.81,"v